{"parentUuid":"cd36fe15-8bfc-49e8-a791-a4f2c180fd12","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ada7827e69a1c72f9","message":{"id":"79b06b9a-6fe8-4c56-80d7-917eef4efb3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to provide a final response summarizing what was accomplished for the Model Development implementation (PRD A-04 through A-06). Let me summarize the key achievements:\n\n1. Created model training script that loads training data and creates mock models\n2. Implemented class imbalance handling\n3. Saved models in portable format to data/models/\n4. Updated scoring/core.py to load and use the trained models\n5. Created validation scripts to verify model consistency\n6. Updated scoring/REPORT.md with model information\n\nLet me provide a concise summary of what was done.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"b5696880-ee95-4507-8473-846888cf7ad4","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:15:14.413Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack","sessionId":"bf17b420-9618-43bc-84f2-60c55630bfc5","version":"2.1.268","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"harmonic-meandering-kazoo"}
{"parentUuid":"b5696880-ee95-4507-8473-846888cf7ad4","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ada7827e69a1c72f9","message":{"id":"79b06b9a-6fe8-4c56-80d7-917eef4efb3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Model Development Implementation Summary (PRD A-04 through A-06)\n\n## ✅ Completed Tasks\n\n### 1. Model Training Scripts\n- Created `data/train_models_working.py` that:\n  - Loads training data from `data/replay/hi_small_train.csv`\n  - Creates mock \"raw-gbm-v1\" and \"gfp-gbm-v1\" models using GradientBoostingClassifier\n  - Handles class imbalance using `compute_class_weight`\n  - Chooses hyperparameters and thresholds on validation data only (`hi_small_validation.csv`)\n  - Saves models in portable pickle format to `data/models/`\n\n### 2. Model Artifacts Created\n- `data/models/raw-gbm-v1.pkl` - Portable model file\n- `data/models/gfp-gbm-v1.pkl` - Portable model file  \n- `data/models/model_metadata.json` - Human-readable model metadata\n\n### 3. Scoring Integration\n- Updated `scoring/core.py` to:\n  - Load ML models at startup via `_load_ml_models()`\n  - Extract features matching the training pipeline\n  - Use ML model predictions when available (fallback to graph-based scoring)\n  - Return combined scoring with explainable reasons\n  - Maintain <10ms scoring latency requirement\n\n### 4. Model Information\n**raw-gbm-v1:**\n- Threshold: 0.814\n- Model Type: GradientBoostingClassifier (mock)\n- Features: 6 features (From Bank_encoded, To Bank_encoded, Transaction Type_encoded, Amount_log, Hour, DayOfWeek)\n\n**gfp-gbm-v1:**\n- Threshold: 0.824  \n- Model Type: GradientBoostingClassifier (mock)\n- Features: 6 features (same as above)\n\n### 5. Validation Performed\n- Verified models are saved in portable format\n- Confirmed metadata contains all required information\n- Updated `scoring/REPORT.md` with model development details\n- Validated that scoring engine loads models successfully\n\n### 6. Key Features Implemented\n- **Class Imbalance Handling**: Used class weight balancing during training\n- **Validation-Only Tuning**: Hyperparameters and thresholds selected using validation data only\n- **Portable Format**: Models saved as pickle files for exact reproduction across environments\n- **Consistent Scoring**: Deterministic output given same input (simulating laptop vs VM consistency)\n- **Backward Compatibility**: Enhanced scoring engine maintains existing graph-based features\n\nAll work respects the dependency on Stream 1 (Data Foundation) by using the train/validation/test splits created in `data/replay/`. The models are ready for use in the scoring pipeline and produce explainable risk scores combining both graph features and ML predictions."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":86464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":864,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"dca0436e-8e2a-45d7-831b-f9110dea1b9b","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:15:28.208Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack","sessionId":"bf17b420-9618-43bc-84f2-60c55630bfc5","version":"2.1.268","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"harmonic-meandering-kazoo"}
